Package: SpaDES.shiny
Type: Package
Title: Shiny Apps for Visualizing 'SpaDES' Simulation Outputs
Description: Tools to build 'shiny' applications for exploring outputs from
    'SpaDES' (Spatial Discrete Event Simulation) projects. Includes 'shine()',
    an interactive viewer that recursively discovers raster ('.tif') and image
    ('.png') outputs, groups time-series of the same object, and presents them
    on web maps (with difference layers) and as figures.
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-12
